/T (*Understanding Holistic Nutrition** Holistic nutrition is a comprehensive approach to health and wellness that considers the whole person, rather than just focusing on individual symptoms or ailments. This approach emphasizes the interconnectedness of the body, mind, and spirit, and how these elements influence overall health. It seeks to balance all aspects of life, including physical, emotional, and spiritual well-being, through the use of natural and organic foods, herbs, and supplements.)
/E (*Understanding Holistic Nutrition** Holistic nutrition is a comprehensive approach to health and wellness that considers the whole person, rather than just focusing on individual symptoms or ailments. This approach emphasizes the interconnectedness of the body, mind, and spirit, and how these elements influence overall health. It seeks to balance all aspects of life, including physical, emotional, and spiritual well-being, through the use of natural and organic foods, herbs, and supplements.)
