/T (### Malnutrition and Nutrition Transition Malnutrition encompasses both undernutrition and overnutrition. In many communities, a nutrition transition occurs when individuals who were previously food insecure suddenly find themselves confronted with an abundance of palatable foods. This transition can lead to a situation where some individuals remain undernourished, while others consume too many macronutrients and insufficient micronutrients.)
