/Title (By removing toxic substances, detoxification strengthens the immune system, allowing the body to combat common ailments more effectively. Moreover, it may result in the improvement or even the complete resolution of chronic conditions. In addition to restoring overall health for both body and mind, detoxification enhances the effectiveness of any subsequent healing therapies. Over time, individuals who maintain proper balance in their bodies can expect a longer lifespan and improved health. They are also less likely to develop progressive diseases such as arthritis, diabetes, and even cancer. Such individuals tend to recover from injuries and illnesses more quickly.)
