/Title (*Protein and Amino Acid Requirements** The body's protein and amino acid needs are governed by processes such as protein synthesis, maintenance of cellular and organ protein content, and protein turnover rates. These processes also include amino acid metabolism activities like synthesis, breakdown, interconversion, transformation, oxidation, and the synthesis of other nitrogen-containing compounds including urea. Factors influencing these requirements include genetic makeup, life cycle stage, physical activity level, dietary intake, nutrient delivery methods, disease presence, hormonal levels, and immune system activity.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1234 0 R
